#. Client info web build identifier shown after the desktop build when the web and desktop channels differ. Example: "Stable Web 2026.518.0". Preserve placeholders.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/ClientInfo.tsx
msgid "{releaseChannel} Web {buildVersion}"
msgstr "{releaseChannel} Web {buildVersion}"

#. Character counter status showing the number of characters remaining.
#: src/features/ui/character_counter/CharacterCountMessages.ts
msgid "{remaining, plural, one {# character left} other {# characters left}}"
msgstr "{remaining, plural, zero {Atlikušas # rakstzīmes} one {Atlikusi # rakstzīme} other {Atlikušas # rakstzīmes}}"

#. Character counter status with an upsell to the premium tier.
