#. Privacy > Profile privacy: note under the section title, shown to people with an Operator Pass or Visionary. "Friends and all communities" is the label of the first option, translate it the same way. {labsName} is the name of the official community, such as Fluxer Labs. Operator and Visionary are role names and #operators is a channel name, keep them as is.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/privacy_safety_tab/ProfilePrivacyTab.tsx
msgid "With any choice other than \"Friends and all communities\", {labsName} shows you without the Operator and Visionary roles, and you keep #operators."
msgstr "Izvēloties jebko citu, nevis „Draugi un visas kopienas“, kopienā {labsName} tu tiec rādīts bez Operator un Visionary lomām, un piekļuve kanālam #operators saglabājas."

